<c.cyan>Oh, Tom is moving quite quickly.</c>

00:02:35.385 --> 00:02:36.975 line:91%
<c.cyan>He's moving quite quickly
towards you.</c>

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.205 line:85%
<c.cyan>You may be wrong.</c>

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.545 line:91%
